{"title":"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A baseball league consists of two four-team divisions. Each team plays every other team in its division <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> games. Each team plays every team in the other division <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> games with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5345bc78b6305a1f3eff93f78a2b79fe6a1383fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N&gt;2M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c7ed5ca66dffaf99ec55e0b4ed27afc720b7c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />. Each team plays a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5db6ea360f9b1367e4db85c18474906401e2c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> game schedule. How many games does a team play within its own division?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a2560f0c21e189238d52a3a7f81fff552b2689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 36 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 48 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 54 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 60 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On one team they play <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afa589b0d34f7ece43bf3a642c908f9d683dbc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3N$\" width=\"25\" height=\"12\" /> games in their division and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/8926ad4630e070abdfeee897da549fbd56837c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> games in the other.  This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0fe6d97e9f95e2638e18755546cfaec01f761ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3N+4M=76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c7ed5ca66dffaf99ec55e0b4ed27afc720b7c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" /> we start by trying M=5. This doesn't work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6392be3c4d257afbc7ed9283bdb8ba630f4ef7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc4d5ec76fcfaec722efc6e2f603cad71af41206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=6$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> does not work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d34d8a56b550e94bb9d81e80345988dccc7afd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=7$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> does work by giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb9658b16ff9f3eb93f4f45bae162c078d111531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b983c47dc1ab057a31ce39202c35c0a3316a6e30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$~M=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9ae25cd94fd4743d5045b7204e2981db9f91b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\times 16=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"137\" height=\"28\" /> games in their division.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/f/b8fa08655c12bb6534fd503f899c48e6da092450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> seems to work, until we realize this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c420ce6df6299255fc314c589195d40a8e20882f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5345bc78b6305a1f3eff93f78a2b79fe6a1383fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N&gt;2M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> so this will not work.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/a/c3a05ecc75fad5b7c52c6c4661253f1052b02c85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76=3N+4M &gt; 10M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"180\" height=\"14\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d643ef60323f90f2df113539e211d63a23fd3dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\le 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c7ed5ca66dffaf99ec55e0b4ed27afc720b7c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5844e43a364a4e74e873243577836e65a77f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=5,6,7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/8926ad4630e070abdfeee897da549fbd56837c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d524c51b59647866bc337983e45d54471e743a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d524c51b59647866bc337983e45d54471e743a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d34d8a56b550e94bb9d81e80345988dccc7afd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=7$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c6bffa966b2f4aaf0212a7036ef8886aaab5ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3N=48$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />, as desired. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f7ff5f0000acb4e6763cf5ed411414a089df2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that each team plays <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> games against each of the three other teams in its division. So that's <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afa589b0d34f7ece43bf3a642c908f9d683dbc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3N$\" width=\"25\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Since each team plays <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> games against each of the four other teams in the other division, that's <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/8926ad4630e070abdfeee897da549fbd56837c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0fe6d97e9f95e2638e18755546cfaec01f761ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3N+4M=76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc76f4cf9526e6002f0d30aed7993a8eec5c2b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;4, N&gt;2M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>Let's start by solving this Diophantine equation. In other words, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/424ab53abda838bacc4dd13f60497ec6256f377f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=\\frac{76-4M}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dcaa674a865cead358b4a71c9a20815a9e7401d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76-4M\\equiv0 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" /> (remember: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> must be divisible by 3 for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> to be an integer!). Therefore, after reducing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5db6ea360f9b1367e4db85c18474906401e2c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/465845714aed9bb0a989c6ab9bbbc0db98140e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/3266113d5495b881ec783fb0da58a679110d4301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2M$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> (we are doing things in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d524c51b59647866bc337983e45d54471e743a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />), we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/9/c3961c244b9a86eb573a85c95b1811076b1e0897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M\\equiv1 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c7ed5ca66dffaf99ec55e0b4ed27afc720b7c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" />, so the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, remember that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5345bc78b6305a1f3eff93f78a2b79fe6a1383fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N&gt;2M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />! To find the greatest possible value of M, we assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/c/32cc93948d04dce0c26f7bc202ee4bf5ab90e9dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=2M$\" width=\"69\" height=\"12\" /> and that is the upper limit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> (excluding that value because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5345bc78b6305a1f3eff93f78a2b79fe6a1383fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N&gt;2M$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />). Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/c/32cc93948d04dce0c26f7bc202ee4bf5ab90e9dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=2M$\" width=\"69\" height=\"12\" /> in, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1dec1f440ac4a625b4499a976df946652d1dc630.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10M=76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88dba103f8f2eee8f80ed24fe2c1f0b3e3316583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&lt;7.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. Since you can't have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682b2e5e778c8fdf97d6ddfedac7105c68afc9be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> games, we know that we can only check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d34d8a56b550e94bb9d81e80345988dccc7afd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=7$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> since we know that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8a1115b0de72fd9cf25af9c1520c4cd89ef4709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&gt;4, M&lt;7.6, M\\equiv1 \\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"263\" height=\"20\" />. After checking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d34d8a56b550e94bb9d81e80345988dccc7afd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=7$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />, we find that it will work.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/4/fa45c0a4d225ee5a4f51e2879112ff45e3ed1ad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=7, N=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />. So each team plays 16 games against each team in its division. Since they are asking for games in it division, which equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b2e08ec3bde4e0abe1acc9ed345a73a636e2743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n = 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. Select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f7ff5f0000acb4e6763cf5ed411414a089df2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />. (P.S: This might be too complicated).\n</p><p>~hastapasta \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HISL2-N5NVg?t=4968\">https://youtu.be/HISL2-N5NVg?t=4968</a> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LiAupwDF0EY\">https://youtu.be/LiAupwDF0EY</a> - Happytwin\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bJSWtw91SLs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bJSWtw91SLs</a> - Oliver Jiang\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0ZMDsuOYGqE\">https://youtu.be/0ZMDsuOYGqE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8\">2015 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2015\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 